      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ٱئْتَبَرَهُ</span></b>  [written with the disjunctive alif <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِيْتَبَرَهُ</span>]
<i>He asked him to fecundate,</i> or <i>to dress,</i> or <i>put
into a good</i> or <i>right</i> or <i>proper state, his palmtrees,</i> or <i>his seed-produce.</i> (T, S, M, * K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَأَرَ</span>.

